      "readme": "This dataset was derived from a 7T fMRI study of N=90 healthy human adults (18-40 years old, M=26.9 years old, SD=6.2 years; 40 females). Participants completed one T1-weighted structural scan and three ten-minute resting-state functional scans. Raw structural and functional data and preprocessed functional data are available here. \n\nPlease cite: Zhang et al. (2025). \"Cortical and subcortical mapping of the allostatic-interoceptive system in the human brain using 7 Tesla fMRI.\" bioRxiv.",
